    "title": "Cardi B Testifies in Assault Case",
    "text": "• Cardi B testified in a Los Angeles County court regarding allegations of assault against a security guard.\n• The security guard, Emani Ellis, claims Cardi B cut her face with a fingernail and spat on her.\n• Cardi B denied touching Ellis and stated the incident did not turn physical.\n• The incident occurred in February 2018 when Cardi B was four months pregnant with her first child.\n• Cardi B expressed anger during the argument, believing Ellis was revealing her secret pregnancy.\n• A receptionist from the doctor's office supported Cardi B's account, stating she saw no physical fighting.",
